  "text": "About | Mobile Veterinarian Cancer Services in Front Range, CO\n720-414-0116\nveterinarycancerservices@gmail.com\nHome\nAbout\nVirtual Appointment\nPet Pics\nSelect Page\nAbout Brooke\nBrooke Fowler is a Veterinary Oncologist who lives in Longmont, Colorado with her 3 wild daughters and her 4 furry dogs. She graduated from the University of Michigan for her undergraduate degree (English major), University of Illinois for Veterinary School, and The University of Missouri for her specialty internship and residency. In residency, her master’s thesis was in regards to the immune system as it relates to cancer. She started and grew an oncology practice in the front range of Colorado and has continued to work in the front range for the past 10 years. She is an avid skier, book reader, cook, wanderluster, and dog enthusiast. She thrives in chaos and believes that there is room for compassion and creativity in medicine.\nEmail my team\n© Veterinary Cancer Services |\nveterinarycancerservices@gmail.com",
